'''Pepper''' was a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[MLG Box]]. Pepper was soon deleted from the game after [[Nikilis]] removed the [[MLG Box]] from the shop due to copyright reasons.

== Appearance ==
The Pepper knife features a crimson blade, a white hilt, and a black handle that has a logo on it.

== Trivia ==
* The logo on the handle of the knife is that of the soda brand called [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dr_Pepper Dr Pepper].
*When the [[MLG Box]] was removed and temporarily replaced with the Chroma Box, this knife had the Dr Pepper logo removed from its handle and was renamed to [[Clay]].
*This, along with every other item in the [[MLG Box]], was removed from all players' [[Inventory|inventories]].

